{
  "id": "multiagent-coder",
  "name": "Multi-agent coder",
  "description": "Chat-agent entrypoint for the multi-agent coding pipeline (scouts -> plan -> gates -> build/verify loop -> docs -> PR -> merge). Defaults to gating_mode=wait: interactive clients answer TWO ask_user gates (plan approval, merge approval). Unattended clients must send gating_mode=auto and input_data._runtime.tool_policy = {\"auto_approve_tools\": [\"execute_command\"]} (or drive approvals externally). workspace_root resolves from the session workspace var or input_data; an empty workspace is refused at preflight (this workflow writes files and runs git).",
  "interfaces": [
    "abstractcode.agent.v1"
  ],
